    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Baseball&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Mahjong&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Pachinko&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Training&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where you can win baseball games just by playing mahjong?!<br>Become the manager of a high school baseball team in another world! Manage and train your team, play mahjong and pachinko, and aim to win the national high school baseball championship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win with Mahjong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/81f2a0303b6faa9dda1a375f762b7232.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mahjong while cheering your team on, and lead them to victory.<br>Your team members will support you with their special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pray with Pachinko</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/2cbc9583deeffa5badf89f5b1035ab13.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the opponent's pitches and spin the reels to extend your mahjong time.<br>Team members\u2019 special abilities come into play here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Team and Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/31416d64506539c07118f4be88e1741b.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/0bd9cae0b41a94343b00694e75871cb9.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your team's location, name, flag, cap, and uniforms.<br>You can also customize each player's name and face\u2014even how they wear their cap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Opponents and Climb the Tournament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have some control over who you'll face in the tournament.<br>You can breeze through by picking weaker schools, or choose strong rivals and make unforgettable memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a completely free game.<br>There are no ads or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Posting Videos and Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless the following prohibited activities are involved, anyone\u2014individuals, companies, or organizations\u2014can post or stream videos and images without prior notice, regardless of monetization or platform.<br>These guidelines may be updated from time to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not slander others, engage in political, religious, or anti-social activities, or spread false information.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Baseball&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Mahjong&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Pachinko&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Training&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where you can win baseball games just by playing mahjong?!<br>Become the manager of a high school baseball team in another world! Manage and train your team, play mahjong and pachinko, and aim to win the national high school baseball championship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win with Mahjong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/81f2a0303b6faa9dda1a375f762b7232.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mahjong while cheering your team on, and lead them to victory.<br>Your team members will support you with their special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pray with Pachinko</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/2cbc9583deeffa5badf89f5b1035ab13.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the opponent's pitches and spin the reels to extend your mahjong time.<br>Team members\u2019 special abilities come into play here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Team and Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/31416d64506539c07118f4be88e1741b.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/0bd9cae0b41a94343b00694e75871cb9.avif?t=1746024921\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your team's location, name, flag, cap, and uniforms.<br>You can also customize each player's name and face\u2014even how they wear their cap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Opponents and Climb the Tournament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have some control over who you'll face in the tournament.<br>You can breeze through by picking weaker schools, or choose strong rivals and make unforgettable memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a completely free game.<br>There are no ads or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Posting Videos and Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless the following prohibited activities are involved, anyone\u2014individuals, companies, or organizations\u2014can post or stream videos and images without prior notice, regardless of monetization or platform.<br>These guidelines may be updated from time to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not slander others, engage in political, religious, or anti-social activities, or spread false information.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Baseball&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Mahjong&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Pachinko&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Training&quot;! A game where just playing mahjong can lead to winning at baseball? Become the manager of a high school baseball team in another world, manage and train your team, play mahjong and pachinko, and lead them to victory!",
